  1822           * ELF executables have multiple section headers in arbitrary
  1823           * file locations and thus file(1) cannot determine it from easily.
  1824           * Instead we traverse thru all section headers until a symbol table
  1825           * one is found or else the binary is stripped.
  1826           * Return immediately if it's not ELF (so we avoid pipe2file unless
  1827           * needed).
  1828           */
